# Build-context hygiene for `podman build` / `docker build` (and the
# identical .containerignore for podman-first hosts). The image rebuilds
# web/dist inside stage 1 and installs server/ editable — anything the
# host already generated is either rebuilt or runtime state:
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.egg-info
**/data
**/backups
.git
docs/reference
deploy
